  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nDiscover our newest collection from Leia Bryans \n\nCart\nGive the gift of unique artwork that’s always the right size and style.\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 1 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n2\nGift Card\nAmount\n$50\n $100\n $150\n $200\n $250\n $300\n $350\n $400\n $450\n $500\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\nShare\n\nArt is a meaningful gift that will live with your loved one for years to come. \n\nWe can mail the gift card to you or send it directly to your recipient with a personalized message included. \n\nThe amount gifted can be used towards any artwork on the site and will never expire. Your recipient can continue to check back as new works are added to ensure they end up with their perfect artwork. \n\nRachel Crummey\nLeia Bryans\nMelanie Keay\nBuild your collection\n\nAll our pieces are carefully chosen to reflect a cohesive, contemporary aesthetic. Simply mix and match to create your unique gallery wall.\n\nShop\nPrints\nOriginals\nArt Objects\nGift Cards\nSearch\nInfo\nOur Story\nJournal\nContact\nOur mission\n\nWe curate affordably priced pieces from the most exciting up-and-coming artists.\n\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-studio-demo Powered by Shopify"
}